@startuml DS-Hidratacao-Tema-Web
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title management-better-meet/web: abertura do painel e hidratação do tema

actor "Administrador" as Adm
participant ":RootLayout (web)" as Root
participant ":SplashScreen" as Splash
participant ":useThemeStore" as Tema
participant ":AsyncStorage" as Disco
participant ":AppGate (web)" as Gate
participant ":useAuthStore (web)" as Auth
participant ":useRouter" as Router

Adm -> Root : abre o painel no navegador
Root -> Splash : preventAutoHideAsync()
Root -> Tema : useThemeStore() com theme = 'light' (estado inicial)

note over Root, Tema
  O primeiro render coincide com o HTML estático,
  que é sempre claro.
end note

Root -> Splash : hideAsync(), no useEffect de montagem
Root -> Tema : rehydrateTheme(), no useEffect de montagem
Tema -> Disco : getItem('management-better-meet-theme')
Disco --> Tema : {theme} ou nada
Tema -> Tema : merge(persistedState, currentState)

alt há tema salvo
  Tema --> Root : theme = savedTheme
else não há tema salvo
  Tema --> Root : theme = getSystemTheme()
end

Root --> Adm : ThemeProvider com o tema aplicado

Root -> Gate : renderiza AppGate
Gate -> Auth : useAuthStore() lê isAuthenticated

alt isAuthenticated = false e segments[0] != 'login'
  Gate -> Router : replace('/login')
else isAuthenticated = true e segments[0] = 'login'
  Gate -> Router : replace('/')
end
@enduml
